ef> <highlight>and we faded away</highlight>, but read perhaps <bdbheb>וַנִּכֹּל</bdbheb> from <bdbheb>נבל</bdbheb> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup>, less probably, derives from <bdbheb>בלל</bdbheb> — compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:8\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,8)\">Hos 7:8</ref> — or <bdbheb>בול</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>נבל</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 11:9", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ps 92:11", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 92, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Gen 11:7", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Exod 29:40", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 29, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "Lev 2:5", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 2, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Exod 29:2", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 29, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Lev 23:13", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 23, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Lev 2:4", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 2, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Lev 14:10", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 14, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Lev 14:21", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 14, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Num 7:13", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Num 7:19", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Num 7:25", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Num 7:31", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Num 7:37", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "Num 7:43", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 43}, {"raw": "Num 7:49", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 49}, {"raw": "Num 7:55", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 55}, {"raw": "Num 7:61", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 61}, {"raw": "Num 7:67", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 67}, {"raw": "Num 7:73", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 73}, {"raw": "Num 7:79", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 7, "verse": 79}, {"raw": "Num 8:8", "book": "NUM", "chapte